==English==

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=the [[triangle]] [[inequality]]}}

{{wikipedia}}

# {{lb|en|analysis}} The [[inequality]] that states that the [[magnitude]] of the [[sum]] of two [[vector]]s is less than or equal to the sum of the magnitudes of the vectors, or any equivalent inequality in other [[space]]s.
#: <math>\|\mathbf x + \mathbf y\| \leq \|\mathbf x\| + \|\mathbf y\|</math>

